# formyprettymom

Before large changes, read `formyprettymom/SDD.md`.

## Product

- Secret travel phrasebook at `/PIO-words/formyprettymom/`
- Languages: English (`en`) + French (`fr`) only
- Content: tourism (reception, shops, directions, asking, liner, transport, cafe)
- Entries have `kind: 'word' | 'phrase'` and transcriptions
- Same study/game modes as Dinara, plus words-only / phrases-only / single-topic
- Restrained teal/slate design (Outfit + Fraunces) — not pink Dinara UI
- localStorage keys must use `mom-` prefix

## Constraints

- Do not modify `dinarasecret/` or root spelling app except CI assemble paths
- Flex layouts only — no `display: grid`
- Components preferably ≤ 150 lines
- Code in English; UI strings in Russian
- Commits: Conventional Commits (English)
